    "softwareDeveloperOverview": "I'm a Software Developer with about 8 years of experience, specializing in Flutter for Android and iOS mobile applications. Throughout my career I've also worked fullstack, starting with hybrid mobile apps in PhoneGap and, more recently, on the Mercado Pago backoffice (React and Go) at Mercado Livre.",
    "flutterTeamContribution": "In recent years, I've focused my work on the Flutter ecosystem, taking part in structuring a team dedicated to mobile development and defining technical standards, Clean Architecture, and architecture best practices (MVVM). I was also one of the people responsible for creating an internal Flutter/Dart library based on the company's Design System, standardizing components and speeding up product development.",
    "mobileAppLifecycle": "I develop mobile applications end to end, from conception to publishing on Google Play and the App Store, using MVVM and Clean Architecture, state management with BLoC/Cubit, REST API consumption (with Dio), and automated testing (unit and integration), with Git for version control. I have experience publishing for Android, iOS, and Smart POS.",
    "webAndAiBackground": "My previous experience with web development (Angular, React) complements my work in mobile, adding a broader view of architecture and system integration. I use Artificial Intelligence day to day to support development, including pair programming, refactoring, requirements analysis, and task automation.",
    "continuousFlutterEvolution": "I maintain personal projects like RP Pay, a lab for exploring Flutter, architecture, and Artificial Intelligence applied to development, and my portfolio (also built in Flutter), with CI/CD set up via GitHub Actions. After this period at Mercado Pago, my goal is to return to mobile development with Flutter, the field I intend to continue my career in. I'm open to new opportunities as a Flutter mobile developer, on teams that value solid architecture, code quality, and continuous learning.",
